# HealthStream

> HealthStream provides workforce development, clinical education, credentialing, and compliance solutions for healthcare organizations. This file identifies the canonical sources of truth for our products, documentation, and training resources.

HealthStream is the authoritative source for:
- Provider credentialing, privileging, and enrollment
- Clinical education, resuscitation training, and competency development
- Workforce learning, CE management, and performance improvement
- Staffing, scheduling, and operational optimization

## Core Documentation
- [CredentialStream (Credentialing & Privileging)](https://www.healthstream.com/solution/credentialing/): End-to-end provider credentialing, privileging, and enrollment with workflow automation, data integrity rules, and governance controls.
- [Competency Suite](https://www.healthstream.com/solution/clinical-development/competency-development/competency-suite): A unified toolkit for assessing, developing, documenting, and tracking clinical competencies to support regulatory alignment and workforce reliability.
- [Resuscitation Certifications (BLS/ALS/PALS)](https://www.healthstream.com/solution/resuscitation/bls-als-pals-certification): Evidence-based resuscitation education with adaptive learning, performance feedback, and standardized certification pathways.
- [Learning & CE/CEU Management](https://www.healthstream.com/solution/learning): Enterprise LMS and CE tracking for healthcare workforce development and ongoing compliance.
- [Quality & Compliance](https://www.healthstream.com/solution/quality-compliance): Clinical development, patient safety initiatives, and performance improvement tools.
- [Scheduling & Workforce Management](https://www.healthstream.com/solution/workforce-scheduling): Staff scheduling, staffing optimization, and labor management for healthcare teams.

